        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Damnit, there's still so many of them out there... I thought the L.G.D. was supposed to have this area under control?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Yesterday it was Reunion, today it's these weird Infected. Even we can't hold them off. And we can't use heavy-duty weapons inside the city..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Hello, Operators. Is that who we're fighting today?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_012",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Rosmontis! Thank goodness, we're saved."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_012",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "They're Infected who have been twisted by Arts...? And we can't stop them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "That's right. We mostly brought defense equipment, but I never expected that they'd shred through our steel cables and polyfiber nets like paper. We might have to bring in some military-grade weapons."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "We're at our limits here, so we had no choice but to ask for backup from the landship. Thankfully, now that you're here, we might be able to turn the tides."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "The Originium structure inside makes their bodies incredibly tough. We use suppressing fire to keep them under control. Also... our scans aren't picking up any signs of brain activity at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "The main point there is, they're pretty much... already physically dead. They're just empty husks, propped up by Arts. It's unbelievably cruel..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Whoever did this... has to pay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "But more importantly, at least you all are safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Let's make a plan. I'll... get them to settle down."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You're going to fight?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "But you look...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Doctor... have you never met Rosmontis before?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Please stand aside, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Then, you might want to take a step back. I guarantee you've never seen anything like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
