        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "It's mine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Operator, please describe your impressions of the target."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Hold on, I'll check the manual... Okay, the target's, uh, a large group of active, restless individuals?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "They're moving as a group with no clear objective. Their general trend is clear, but with no set route. That should be good enough, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Received. I'll handle this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit was very clear, once we finish with this, Rhodes Island is to leave Lungmen immediately...!"
    },
