        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hoshiguma...? What are you doing here? How about your injuries?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I'm an Oni. Those scratches are long gone."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$drift_intro",
            "key": "$drift_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Good. Now, I\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hold on. Were you waiting for me here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That dune buggy you're pushing is a new model from Rim Billiton, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "'Great for off-road performance. Dustproof, climbs hills with ease, incredible range and fuel efficiency. Minimal environmental impact with maximum comfort.' That one?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Yeah, sorry. I saw that ad on the terminal a million times. Guess it got stuck in the old noggin."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It's a damn good buggy though. I'm not even into off-roading and I'd like to get one."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What are you trying to say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
