    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You look like hell, Ch'en. Where do you plan on going?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "How did you know I'd be here...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You come here every time you want to sneak out of the city. Remember, I also know every nook and cranny of this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "The L.G.D. issued an arrest warrant."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But that's not what you're here for."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Of course not. I know exactly what kind of person you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "This is my only way out of Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I stayed dark the whole way. If the whole L.G.D. knew me half as well as you do..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Then you'll never make it out of Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...Excuse me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What do you mean by that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "They're just like me. They don't want you to go."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hoshiguma... are you going to stop me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Why you, of all people, Hoshiguma?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Of course I am, Ch'en. I'm an L.G.D. inspector, and more importantly, your friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Did you seriously plan to wander off and play the lone hero on a grand adventure? That is precisely why I cannot let you leave."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You're a Lungmenite, Hoshiguma!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "This is our last chance. If Wei Yenwu has it his way, more people are going to die!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "And your way is better?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "They call you 'Madame Oni.' They trust you to take care of the Lungmen they love so much. Let me go, Hoshiguma."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Do they really love Lungmen, Ch'en?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You\u2014"
    },
