        "text": "Comics, movies, booze, rainy streets, some guy running by without an umbrella. I like my stuff retro, just not bikes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "People say some stuff goes out of style quick. Ch'en, can we really outrun time itself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I can't. No way. It moves too fast. That chase has crushed so much of what I cared about."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "This is all I have left. A yellowed splotch, a tear, a dog-eared page. I've got names for 'em all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "And it sucks. I hate how time took all these people from me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "They died horrible, miserable deaths, sacrificing themselves to try to find a place in this world. But me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I simply watched them all vanish into dust. Some of them? I smashed their dreams to pieces with these very two hands."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "They didn't love Lungmen. They simply had nowhere else to go. And in the end, that was my fault."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You're not going anywhere, Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Ah Faat died, all those people died for Lungmen... You're going to pretend you never saw any of that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Don't act like you knew them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "They were with me a lot longer than you. I knew them much better than you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It's my duty to protect Lungmen. No matter who stands in my way, it's my duty. That hasn't changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "So you're still Superintendent Ch'en? And who gave you this duty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I did."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...Is that just something you wanted to hear yourself say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Look at you. You're gonna save Lungmen all by yourself? One woman against all of Reunion? Your temper tantrum won't get you that far."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It's funny. You're the one who always carried out Mr. Wei's orders, because you could relate with him. Now I'm the one who relates with him a bit better, and I'm the one carrying out his orders. How the tables have turned."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I've seen the gist of Mr. Wei's plans. If someone has to die, Mr. Wei thinks it ought to be him. You're carrying the Ch'en family's blood. Once all this blows over, no one's coming after you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You mean, he\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Mr. Wei would rather he die than you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You give him too much credit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Maybe you don't give him enough, Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If he wants to die, he's welcome to it. But what will that get us? What's the point? Will it prevent a war? Will it get Lungmen out of this mess?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "If he dies, it'll get some of the blame off Lungmen. I think all the blame will pretty much vanish into thin air, actually."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You really think it'll be that easy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Nothing's ever that easy. That's why he wants you running the L.G.D."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You'll get his job and be Chief of the L.G.D. sooner or later. After that, you'll become the boss of the entire city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "There's been a lot of rot left behind, and you should be the one to clean it out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I get what Mr. Wei wants from you. Though he's been waiting for a long time, I can tell that his beliefs and methods haven't changed from the day I met him."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.6,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "avg_7_3",
            "x": -400,
            "y": -250,
            "xscale": 1.5,
            "yscale": 1.5,
