        }
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "xfrom": -400,
            "yfrom": -250,
            "x": -200,
            "y": -250,
            "xscale": 2,
            "yscale": 2,
            "duration": 60,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.6,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Lungmen still needs you. And she doesn't want you in danger."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I'm just so disgusted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Mr. Wei's death may not matter to you. But once he's gone, you can change this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I have to tell you something, Hoshiguma. It's the reason I don't belong here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Don't mess with me, Ch'en. No one's more Lungmen than you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I'm an Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...Since when...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Three years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You've been hiding it from me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I didn't mean to..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "How come you didn't even tell me...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Wei Yenwu didn't want anyone to know. We couldn't have an Infected in the L.G.D. So I couldn't be Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hoshiguma, there is no place for the Infected here. Or anywhere else in the world."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I've had enough of Wei Yenwu controlling us. I'm not going to be his tool anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "No. I get it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I finally... actually, really get it, Ch'en. I know exactly why you can't leave Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "If you leave and go to that core city, Mr. Wei would have to brand you an enemy. Not just an enemy, but a dangerous Infected enemy working against Lungmen..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "The whole city would know you're Infected. They might even think you're working with Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "And that'll be the end of it. You'll never be able to come back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I don't care."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's my line."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "'You're Infected? I don't care.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I don't care. Missy doesn't care. Nine doesn't care. The L.G.D. doesn't care."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Not even Mr. Wei cares. He wants you to change this place. He doesn't want you gone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You didn't see how ruthlessly he treated the Infected. I did."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And Nine? She's already gone. She quit the L.G.D. because she was Infected too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...Nine too...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You know, Nine and I might've contracted Oripathy on the same mission."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "She went undercover for me in Reunion... And then, because of Reunion, she abandoned Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Because she saw the truth of this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "But you didn't betray Lungmen. I'm not letting you take the fall for a crime you didn't commit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hoshiguma, why do you think... I'm going to the core city?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I've never been good at guessing games. Just get to the point."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Heh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Do you know who's leading Reunion?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I forgot her name."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Talulah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Missy didn't tell you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Tell me what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Talulah is my sister."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
