        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Oh. Ohhh... Hah. I get it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Ch'en, you're not going today."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$nervous_intro",
            "key": "$nervous_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...Why...? Is my sister, my family... not important enough?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's why..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's why I can't let you go."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Even if I have to die here. I'm not letting you go."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's not for you to decide, Hoshiguma."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Hannya can decide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "\u2014No matter what stands in my way, whether it's a Catastrophe, a shield, or an Oni, I'm not giving in!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "The blacksmith who cast this shield had his whole family killed by a gang of wandering Onis. His fury is much more toxic than any Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "The blood that stains this shield, and the tragedy it represents... is much more wicked than any Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Ch'en, Mr. Wei isn't a good man. We can kick his ass together."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Whatever you want to do, I'll do it with you. You want my Columbian Big Single 70 vv? It's yours."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Ch'en, now's not the time. Don't go. Don't force me to do this. It's all I ask."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Force you? Why are you talking like Wei Yenwu...? I don't like it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "When Wei did what he did... no."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "When he betrayed his brother, failed my mother, and put this city to sleep under his cloud of wickedness, that's when I decided to do this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You might think that stuff has anything to do with you, but I don't think so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What do you mean...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What he did, what he did for you, and what you should be doing, none of it is connected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's what Mr. Wei was hoping for. He didn't want to play the bad guy. He's not power-hungry..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "He gave you the sword."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...You don't get it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Understand what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It wasn't just one time. It happened again, and again, and again... I destroyed my home, I destroyed my family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Covered horn to toe in blood every time, I fought to the bitter end, until I was the only one left standing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Because that's what I thought was right. And they were wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I found myself asking a lot if I really deserved to live."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I don't. But I lived anyway. I just can't live for myself anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Putting yourself out because of some concept of right and wrong... that's the dumbest thing a person can do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "And I've dealt with the regret my whole life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You think you're the only one who's got a lot of baggage, Miss Ch'en?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Stop talking like that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...So why can't you understand me, even a little bit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "We've been through so much together, all these years. There's still something you can't tell me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I've got my baggage and you've got yours. We both know that. Even so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What is there you still don't understand? I never pulled any of you into this! How can you say I don't understand you?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Because I've seen too many people die for nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I don't care who you are. I just care where you're going."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I'm not letting you go. This is all on the leader of Reunion. You can't change the situation. You'll just die for nothing too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "No one wants to see that. Not the L.G.D., not Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "\u2014Thank you, Hoshiguma."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But I'm still going."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
